cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use data from Apprentix, please cite both Apprentix and the original
  publisher named in each record's or indicator's provenance (for example
  Cedefop or Eurostat). The original source remains authoritative.
title: "Apprentix: European apprenticeship and VET data, made searchable"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Rezlescu
    given-names: Constantin
url: "https://apprentix.eu"
repository-code: "https://github.com/costirezlescu/apprentix.eu"
abstract: >-
  Republished public European data on apprenticeship and vocational education
  and training (VET), refreshed weekly with per-record provenance: Cedefop's
  apprenticeship schemes (34, with Cedefop's coded answers), VET policy timeline,
  financing instruments, NQF levels, VET systems and Regional skills ecosystem
  index (244 regions); 108 statistical indicators from Cedefop, Eurostat, OECD,
  UNESCO UIS, Erasmus+ and national statistics offices (Switzerland, Germany,
  Denmark, Finland, France, Ireland, Netherlands, Norway, England); Europass VET
  qualifications; Erasmus+ accredited VET organisations and Centres of
  Vocational Excellence. Each resource keeps its original publisher's licence;
  the website code is MIT-licensed.
version: "1.0.0"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23426138
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23426138
    description: All versions (always resolves to the latest release)
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23426139
    description: Version 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-17"
keywords:
  - apprenticeship
  - vocational education and training
